Elbereth, Gilthoniel! is the star-goddess and matron saint of the elves in
middle earth. in hack, Elbereth is engraved (the E command) on the ground.
if it is written correctly (doesn't always happen!) and you're standing on
it then adjacent monsters (non-@'s) that would normally attack you will
flee instead. they may use missile attacks and they will eventually return.
writing the word should be viewed as good defense not good offense. if
you use weapons to write the word (it may take two to write it completely,
since the blade will become dull in the process) it takes longer to
write and is significantly more enduring (that's good and bad!). you may
use other items to engrave, with different effects, but eventually the
word will become corrupted (and therefore ineffective) unless, of
course, you can stand over it without occasionally kicking dirt onto it.

